  "solution": "__**BODMAS RULE**__:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nWe check each Option:\n\n**Option 1: **39 and 27\n\nGiven equation: 39 x 6 + 27 ÷ 3 - 52 = 123\n\nAfter the interchange, a new equation : 27 x 6 + 39 ÷ 3 - 52 = 123\n\n⇒ 27 x 6 + __**39 ÷ 3**__ - 52 = 123\n\n⇒ **2**__**7 x 6 **__+ 13 - 52 = 123\n\n⇒ __**162 + 13**__ - 52 = 123\n\n⇒ __**175 - 52**__ = 123\n\n**123 = 123**\n\n**Option 2: **3 and 6\n\nGiven equation: 39 x 6 + 27 ÷ 3 - 52 = 123\n\nAfter the interchange, a new equation : 39 x 3 + 27 ÷ 6 - 52 = 123\n\n⇒ 39 x 3 + __**27**____** ÷ 6**__ - 52 = 123\n\n⇒ __**39 x 3**____** **__+ 4.5 - 52 = 123 \n\n⇒ 117 + 4.5 - 52 = 123\n\n⇒ __**1**____**21.5 - 52**__ = 123\n\n**69.5 ≠ 123**\n\nOption 3: 3 and 52\n\nGiven equation: 39 x 6 + 27 ÷ 3 - 52 = 123\n\nAfter the interchange, a new equation : 39 x 6 + 27 ÷ 52 - 3 = 123\n\n⇒ 39 x 6 + __**27 ÷ 52**__ - 3 = 123\n\n⇒ __**39 x 6**__ + 0.519 - 3 = 123\n\n⇒ **__234 + 0.519__** - 3 = 123\n\n⇒ __**234.519 - 3**__ = 123\n\n**231.519 ≠ 123 **\n\nOption 4: 39 and 52\n\nGiven equation: 39 x 6 + 27 ÷ 3 - 52 = 123\n\nAfter the interchange, a new equation : 52 x 6 + 27 ÷ 3 - 39 = 123\n\n⇒ 52 x 6 + __27 ÷ 3__ - 39 = 123\n\n⇒ __52____ x 6__ + 9 - 39 = 123\n\n⇒ __312 + 9__ - 39 =123\n\n⇒ __321 - 39__ = 123\n\n282 ≠ 123\n\nHence, The correct answer is **\"39 and 27\"**.",
